    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Yefta was siida Gileyadi, niny siida haw Uri gil, nea niny ea orjeeda gatmooda hiseada gil; Gileyadi gwaji Yefta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gatmooni bea Gileyadi gwajiilsa niny orjooga; ak orjoosu bea gatmooni iinea gwaheetu ak gooruuta Yefta, ak gwayeesha “Ang'iing'i may hearaniischeena aba ghaheanya; aba gideaba ang'iing'i guwoosi orjeeda gatmu nuut.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gamng'awa Yefta heeda orjooga geenyaawa, goobiida ng'eanyiida Dobu; ng'ata gwaroonyi sea fuga gwaneadi ak gwaneaydooschi sea niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gang'uchi fuga Amoni sea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa iinea gang'uchi fuga Amoni sea Israeli gaweay gweargwa Gileyadi ghamwaghaada Yefta aba ng'eanyiida Dobu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyeesha Yefta “Beeni huwa sugoocheandeanya, ak abeeda gajeamuusa eeng'ucheewana fuga Amoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yefta gweargwa Gileyadi, “Agooga ghayi moastani ak ghoahoanyaani dariteawa ghaheanya? Ghamneawa agooga gooyeawusean ghwasaan damanda oondi jeeda sawanadeeda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha gweargwa Gileyadi Yefta, “Aba ng'asheesu ghamneawa aseasa siyamseey geat gicha, gideaba gajadeayeeweasa ak ging'ucheewi fuga Amoni, ak gayhuuwa siichea gamiineadayseasa ea fuga sean bea ng'eanyiida Gileyadi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yefta gweargwa Gileyadi, “Iyoatealdanaani ghoah gicha dang'uchi sea fuga Amoni, ak inyas ghoang'aamwaneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA madeedeanyu, abeeda aniini gaydawoos siichea ghoahaaghwaneegwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha gweargwa Gileyadi Yefta, “NG'UTAMIIDA niny gayghoah siida gheang'da aba bugusteanya, ak aba huumwa gajeesinda giduurji ng'asheandaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goodeayi Yefta sea gweargwa Gileyadi, ak geanung' ghoah siichea goosheedeawa saawa, sugoocheanda, jea gamiineadaysa saawa; hean gwarukusa Yefta ng'asheagaaschi sean NG'UTAMIIDA aba Mispa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta Yefta giijasoodiga heeda sugoocheanda fuga Amoni, ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i geendeayeesi naaha iiy bwak ea nyunyi ng'ucheena sea ng'eanyiideanyu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda fuga Amoni ghwasha ghuusiga fuga giijasoodiga Yefta, “Aba gideaba Israeli ghayi gageanda ng'eanyiideanyu, damanda ghayi rinna ng'eanyiida Misri gidang'eada Arnoni ea gagul Yaboki, bwak ea ghwahita Yordani asi adeelni ng'eanyoojisu nea manda jaliida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta Yefta giijasoodiga niba iyeenya gaweay heeda sugoocheanda fuga Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeyeesha, “Gwayi Yefta giijasoodiga Israeli miigageanda ng'eanyiida Moabu, ghana ng'eanyiida fuga Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinea gwarina Misri, fuga Israeli gwasik mooheeda ea ghwahita basooda Shaamu, bwak ea ghwahita Gadeshi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata goojeakta gicha fuga Israeli giijasoodiga gaweay heeda sugoocheanda Edomu, ak gwayeesha, ‘Geamuscheey goonean beata dasik bugusta ng'eanyiidaang'u’; nea sugoocheanda Edomu ea manda heeda. Hean goojeaksa sugoocheanda Moabu giijasoodiga; ak eara niny ea mamwasa; hean goobiida Israeli ng'eanyiida Gadeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa jeeda dareapcheeda, ak gwaneay aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Edomu ea Moabu, ak gaweay heeda ghayeaweewa Moabu, ak gwasin museasooniga aba meatkweeda niirja bea Arnoni; nea ea miigaweayi jeeda moonghooda Moabu, aba gideaba Arnoni moonghooda Moabu gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta Israeli giijasoodiga heeda sugoocheanda Amori siguura Sihoni was sugoocheanda Heshboni, Ak gwayeesha Israeli ‘geamuscheey gooneasa naweeda jea eesiga bugusta ng'eanyiidaang'u, bwak ea eehisiin ng'eanyiideanya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Sihoni ea mwayiina masaweega gideaba gayghwala Israeli bugusta ng'eanyiidaanyi, Hean ghoamughuush Sihoni fugaaschi sean aba hijagi, ak gooduuw museasooniga aba Yahasi, ak gang'uchi sea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli ghwaahaak Sihoni sea fugaaschi sean geatinga Israeli, ak ghwanung' eajoar saawa. Hean goombali Israeli ng'eanyiida sean bea Amori ghayi abiita hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goombali eara moonghajeega sean bea Amori gidang'eada Arnoni ea gagul Yaboki ea gidang'eada dareapcheeda ea gagul Yordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamneawa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli niing'aamwa fuga Amori madeeda fugaaschi bea Israeli; ak ang'iing'i gigasayi ambala saawa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'i neada ea majambala gidagoonyi Gemoshi was ASEATAANG'U jea ambala. Ea siisi nyooh ghoang'aamwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA madeedeanya, gajeembala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa agooga goowooschi doobiiweadi ea anaawana Balaki was orjeeda Sibori, was sugoocheanda Moabu? Niny ghayi gajea ning'aleali Israeli, ghana nuwa gang'uchi sea saawa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheata mideewa Israeli Heshboni ea gharang'weakaaschi, ea ng'eanyiida Arori ea gharang'weakaaschi, ea jeeda mujiinajeega sean mida murdajeega Arnoni, aba gweanyeew bughalaji samwagu, ghwasaan anda miyootealda saawa aba jeedeaba gweanyeeksu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini ghamneawa miidasinneey riing'eeda ak ang'iing'i gisinneani ng'asheanda muy aba gideaba ging'ucheewean; NG'UTAMIIDA was siida laja girgweaguutka, danung' ghoah siichea ghwalach girgweageeda askweareani aba bugusta fuga Israeli ea gea Amoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea sugoocheanda fuga Amoni ea mooleeysiina iita ng'asheanda ghayi ajeaksa niny Yefta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu guroorooda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Yefta, ak ghwala bugusta Gileyadi ea Manase, ak ghang'ata ea ghwahita Mispa bea Gileyadi, ak iing'eada Mispaheeda Gileyadi ghang'ata gawa heeda fuga Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweaksa Yefta habeawooda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwayeesha, “Inyas gajiina fuga Amoni geatingeasu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gilinyoo gwarina ghuusigeaba gheenyu ghwadeaptanaan, gheata eabiikni reang'deayda fuga Amoni, ng'asheanji gaygaba NG'UTAMIIDA, ak abeeda gaydaadaw lukghumajeega haleanjeeda sigwariida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoaghaaw Yefta gawa gang'uchi sea fuga Amoni; ng'ata ghwaahaak NG'UTAMIIDA saawa geatingaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabwar goosha aba gidang'eada Aroeri ea gagal Miniti, mujiinaji diktam, bwak ea ghwahita Abel-geramimu, ak ghabwar aba miyeeda haw. Hean fuga Amoni geajoar aba madeeda fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Huda Yefta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiigu Yefta gheanyi mida Mispa; ak ging'ulayi gwardu jarooda hudaanyi ghwadeapta nea gwasaraman nea ghang'was; nea ea hudaanyi ghus gil; nea badaydaanyi ea manda orjeeda ghana hut nuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinea ghwadaah hudaanyi, ghabwaashaada hang'weakaaschi, ak gwayeesha, “Ea hudeanyu, ang'iing'i niihiing'danaani muuchi, nea gibea jeeda fuga ahaagan sawanadeeda; aba gideaba ghayi neayeaksi habeawooda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak nea ea maygudu dabiikta bwadaw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Ea bwaabwa, iiniyeaksi habeawooda NG'UTAMIIDA, gisimaneani gidaghayi rukuta ghuutaang'u, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA niwalda aba badayda weajoodigaagu, was fuga Amoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha ghwaan, “Nung'waada eesimanean ng'asheanji; anung'waada dandeawa geawi sheeh iyeenya, dawa uhuuda giijeeda, ak geayeawdi huduumeedeanyu, aniini ea seaygeedeanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Una.” Ghwanung' gawa gwasheagiit aba sheeh iyeenya, hean gawa niny sea seaygeadaanyi, ak gagutu heareega huduumeadaanyi aba uhuuda giijeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata huuydeanda sheedeaba iyeenya, gabiikta heeda ghwaan, ak gwasima gidaghayi akta habeawooda. Nea abeeda ea mii gwaroonyi ng'eedeeda. Ak ghoah deaweeda aba Israeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba haweega gilakweayi inyeesa gaweay gagutu heareega aba badayda huda Yefta, was siida Gileyadi, eawooji ang'wan aba jeeda gweayda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
